      "summary": "Build on Jaren 0.201.0. Its calendar repeats monthly and yearly by the iCalendar standard, so the desktop Calendar now offers \"Every month\" and \"Every year\", and its editor says when a series skips a date that a month or year lacks. The Pages playground is now built on Jaren's play host kit instead of a copy of Jaren's site: a saved or shared session no longer carries a message language and opens in its reader's, and an example made to show one language shows it for its own run.",
      "id": "jaren-foundation-0-201-0"
    }
